{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16106250","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16106250","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1610625001:1":{"text":"실벤, 피파와 카세디아의 심문은 끝났네요. 그로웬은 별도의 담당자가 있으니 이제 아니타를 불러올까요? 아니면 라벤디?","source_cn":"休、皮帕和科丝蒂已经审讯完了，格墨文另有人负责，接下来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA945E675A55F676","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1610625002:1":{"text":"아니요. 현장 상황을 보니 <style=\"highlight\">니엘</style>과 먼저 대화해 보고 싶네요.","source_cn":"不，考虑到现场情况，我希望先和<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x224983C5F9E945F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1610625003:1":{"text":"음... 지금은 곤란할 것 같습니다. 니엘은 모든 마력을 잃어 굉장히 약해진 상태라 병원에서 회복 중이거든요.","source_cn":"尼尔？他……我认为不应该叫他来，嗯……他突然失去了全部...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x697631187F6556C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1610625004:1":{"text":"아무리 마력을 잃었다 해도 걷거나 말할 정도는 되겠지요? 몇 가지 질문만 할 뿐입니다. ","source_cn":"只是问几个问题而已，他虽然失去了魔力，但应该没虚弱到无...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC684ECD897584577","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1610625005:1":{"text":"이브 특사님, 그래도 그건 조금... 교장 대리로서 저에게도 학생의 건강을 책임질 의무가 있습니다.","source_cn":"伊芙特使，这恐怕不合适……作为代理校长，我必须要对学生...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDED40DF3EDA786AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1610625006:1":{"text":"그러니 니엘이 건강을 회복한 뒤에 다시...","source_cn":"我们应该等尼尔彻底康复以后再……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5C80FA6D80D9F62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1610625007:1":{"text":"아니요, 지금 당장 진행하는 걸로 하죠. 두르엘라 님도 니엘이 하루빨리 혐의를 벗길 바라시죠?","source_cn":"不，必须现在。杜瑞拉女士，校方应该希望他能尽快洗清嫌疑吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A6AAD068DD9C402","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1610625008:1":{"text":"혐의는 당연히 벗어야 하지만... 음? 누가 <style=\"highlight\">노크</style>를?","source_cn":"洗清嫌疑当然是必要的，但我还是认为……嗯？谁在<sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0122C0CF6F3BED17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1610625009:0":{"text":"실례합니다, 이브 님. 귀족 사무관이 <style=\"highlight\">그로웬 님의 심문 보고서</style>를 보내왔습니다. 확인해 주십시오.","source_cn":"打扰了，伊芙大人，这份是贵族事务官提交的<style=...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8284FC6C22ECF5C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1610625010:1":{"text":"아, 그로웬의 보고서군요. 그럼 이걸 먼저...","source_cn":"啊，格墨文的报告，我们应该先看看这个……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80016234E842616B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1610625011:1":{"text":"아니요. 니엘을 불러주세요. 물어봐야 할 게 많습니다. ","source_cn":"不，还是请你将尼尔带来，我这里有很多问题需要他的回答。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F064074B0E71B89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1610625012:0":{"text":"경보음?! 설마 침입자가 있는 건가요? 주변을 둘러봐야 하니 심문은 장시 중단하겠습니다.","source_cn":"有警报！有人闯入吗？审讯先暂停，我要巡查一下这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9521610126519DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1610625013:1":{"text":"경보음? 이... 이게 무슨 일이죠?","source_cn":"警报？怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1889C8C0C3D1A6BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:杜瑞拉":{"text":"두르엘라","source":"杜瑞拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:伊芙":{"text":"이브","source":"伊芙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:传令卫兵":{"text":"전령병","source":"传令卫兵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":3}}